examples.question_text:
Name the solid made by this net.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=8mm,y=8mm,draw=black]
\foreach \x/\y in {0/0,1/0,2/0,3/0,2/1,2/-1}{\draw (\x,\y) rectangle ++(1,1);}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Name the prism made by this net.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=8mm,y=8mm,draw=black]
\foreach \x in {0,2,4}{\draw (\x,0) rectangle ++(2,3);}
\draw (2,3)--(3,{3+sqrt(3)})--(4,3);
\draw (4,0)--(5,{-sqrt(3)})--(6,0);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Name the solid made by this net.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=8mm,y=8mm,draw=black]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (2,2);
\draw (0,0)--(1,-2)--(2,0);
\draw (2,0)--(4,1)--(2,2);
\draw (2,2)--(1,4)--(0,2);
\draw (0,2)--(-2,1)--(0,0);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Name the solid made by this net.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=10mm,y=10mm,draw=black]
\draw (0,0)--(4,0)--(2,{2*sqrt(3)})--cycle;
\draw (1,{sqrt(3)})--(3,{sqrt(3)})--(2,0)--cycle;
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Name the solid made by this net.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=8mm,y=8mm,draw=black]
\draw (0,0) rectangle ({1.4*pi},2.5);
\draw (0.7,-0.7) circle (0.7);
\draw ({1.4*pi-0.7},3.2) circle (0.7);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
